      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumatu waAbimeleki mwahiriili Tola mwana kaPuwa, Puwamwana kaDodo, iyala wakuIsakari, hakunyamuka nakuyamwina aIsarela. Yena washakamini muShamiri, mwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumatu windi mwahiŋili Yayiri, mimtu wamuGileyadi; yena wayihosheleleli aIsarela nyiŋa yawu nyaka makumi ayedi nanyaka yiyedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela elili cheŋi chatama kumesu aYehova, apesheli aBayali, niaAshitoreti, niakishi akuSiriya, niakishi akuZidoni, niakishi akuMowabi, niakishi awanyana kaAmoni, niakishi awaFwilistinu; Yehova amulekeli, hiyamukalakeleluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wazuwili nawaIsarela, wayilandishili kudi aFwilistinu nikudi anyana kaAmoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayi mwesheli yihuŋu nakuyikabisha anyana kaIsarela mwaka wuna; anyana kaIsarela ejima adiŋi kwishinadi daYodana, mwituŋa dawaAmori, dekala muGileyadi, ayikabishilinyaka ikumi nanyaka yitanu nayisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAmoni azambukili Yodana, akalwi naYuda naBenjamini nimutaŋa waEfweremi; dichi aIsarela amweni kukala nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela alembeli kudi Yehova nawu, Tunavulumuni dehi nanichi chitunaleki Nzambi yetu, hitukupesha aBayali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wayilili anyana kaIsarela, nindi, Ami hiyami nayamwinini kudi aEjipitu, nikudi aAmori, nikudi anyana kaAmoni, nikudi aFwilistinuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Nia-Zidoni niaAmaleki niaMawoni ayikabishili nawa; enu mwalembeli kudami, ami nayamwinini kudi wena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila enu saŋa mwanlekela, himukupeshani akishi; dichi ami kwami hinakayamwina nawa chepuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAmoni apompa nikupompa, atuŋa nichilombu muGileyadi. Anyana kaIsarela niwena adipompesheli, atupili chilombu muMizipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niantu, wowu atulamba amuGileyadi, hiyakudihula nawu, iyala nyiwu kutachika njita nawanyana kaAmoni? Diyi wakekala mwanta waeni-Gileyadi ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
